        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "We're here. This path... connects the palace and the ducal manor."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "(Whispers) ...Golden mane."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Totter",
        "text": "What did you just say, Vina?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "No, it's nothing. It's been a long time since I saw them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Not long ago, we left this place. Today, we walk these ancient bricks again. This path has likely never been trodden this frequently."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "It was only meant for emergencies."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Totter",
        "text": "Too bad. Be it the ducal manor or the palace, it has never really served anyone in their time of need."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dagda",
        "text": "Mercenary, if you don't want to buy everyone here a drink, you'd better not joke about that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Totter",
        "text": "Right then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "Allerdale, you said I once came back through this passage with the Sighs of Kings..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "I really don't remember that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "This has me very restless. It's as though I am purposefully avoiding a great responsibility."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Vina, it's okay. You were too young then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Anyone who tried to force any kind of responsibility onto a child that had only just learnt to speak would have to be extraordinarily selfish. No mistake about it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Apologies. I might have insulted someone close to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "Hm, actually, I rather agree with what you said."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "But now, we've come back nonetheless."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "'Responsibility'? 'Miracles'? I have no idea what they expected of me, nor do I really care."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "But I stand here today, and I have something I must accomplish."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "I shan't take on any titles because of it. I'm doing this... so that the people will know peace again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Hah... We are approaching our objective, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Sirs, please tear down the brick wall blocking the path up ahead. Be quiet. Don't let them find us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "We need to go down from here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "Right, I..."
    },
