            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Totter",
        "text": "No one on our tail."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Mercenary",
        "text": "The Sarkaz couldn't have figured we would go down."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Mercenary",
        "text": "They must be throwing quite the party above us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "It's possible that our allies are sacrificing their lives in this intense battle."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "I was actually apprehensive when Allerdale proposed this plan."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "I should be standing with the Corps fighters... and the Rhodes Islanders."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "The Doctor's plan is meant to ensure our operation remains undetected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "No matter what happens aboveground, we must get our hands on the Sighs of Kings."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "It is the key to foiling the Sarkaz's plans and can even turn the tide of the war."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_405_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morgan",
        "text": "This sword... I've only heard of it in the stories."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "It was the sword of the Aslan forefathers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "As the legend goes, it was forged for the Aslans by the fairy of the grasslands. A pasha of yore once beheaded the Poltergeist King with it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Then, the Aslans came to Victoria to rule, and it became the symbol of their reign."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "According to some historical records, in the days before the nomadic cities came to be, the kings once cleaved Catastrophes with it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "For centuries, there was not a single storm to threaten Londinium."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "The masses believed that as long as the Sighs of Kings remains, Londinium would overcome all her foes forever, be they powerful poltergeists or terrifying Catastrophes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_405_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morgan",
        "text": "You can't really believe..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_396_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dagda",
        "text": "I do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Indra",
        "text": "I... I believe in Vina."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_405_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morgan",
        "text": "It's like you're trying to change the subject. Of course I believe in Vina too, but you can tell right away it's just a fairy tale. That's not real..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "That is in fact not a fabrication to legitimize the Aslans' reign. It really can cleave Catastrophes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "If The Shard, with its ability to pull in storms, is Victoria's spear against the outside world, then the Sighs of Kings, capable of rending Catastrophes asunder, is its strongest shield."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "The spear is known far and wide, yet the shield exists almost only in legend."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "But if we are able to wield this power, we will almost certainly be able to stop the Sarkaz's ambitions."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "Allerdale, you're very familiar with our Realmblade."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "I... I'm only fulfilling my responsibilities as a member of House Cumberland."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Siege",
        "text": "Have you seen the blade with your own eyes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Yes, but only once."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "What I saw... was something that could only happen in a dream."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_396_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dagda",
        "text": "What did the blade look like?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "It... It was beautiful."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "It has the power to liven one's heart. The moment you lay your eyes upon it, you'll believe from the pit of your soul that you can triumph over anything."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_405_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morgan",
        "text": "A bit over the top, innit?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Indra",
        "text": "Legends... Legends..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Indra",
        "text": "Maybe that's about the Sarkaz? Is that sword especially good at cutting Sarkaz?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morgan",
        "text": "Is cutting all you think about?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morgan",
        "text": "If Vina had beaten that Sanguinarch bloody with her hammer the other day, it'd have a story like that in two hundred years."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Haha, that just might happen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Then Rhodes Island will become the fairy that bestowed the hammer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_396_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dagda",
        "text": "Closure'll probably be happy about that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morgan",
        "text": "'The Ark of God in the barrenlands! The return of the king!'"
