        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Indra",
        "text": "In twenty years, the story of the 'Great King Vina, leading the Londiniers to chase out the King of Sarkaz' is bound to become a favorite story of all the kids that run around in front of our houses!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_405_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morgan",
        "text": "Then I've got to spend some time thinking how to better tell Vina's story... Hm..."
    },
