    },
    {
        "command": "subtitle",
        "params": {
            "text": "She runs and runs for a long, long time. She's forgotten where she started and where she is going. She's almost cried all the tears she has, and the path before her is so long that she can't see its end.",
            "x": 300,
            "y": 370,
            "alignment": "center",
            "size": 24,
            "delay": 0.04,
            "width": 750
        },
        "text": "She runs and runs for a long, long time. She's forgotten where she started and where she is going. She's almost cried all the tears she has, and the path before her is so long that she can't see its end."
    },
    {
        "command": "subtitle",
        "params": {
            "text": "She runs and runs, and a huge, golden mane appears beneath her.",
            "x": 300,
            "y": 370,
            "alignment": "center",
            "size": 24,
            "delay": 0.04,
            "width": 700
        },
        "text": "She runs and runs, and a huge, golden mane appears beneath her."
    },
    {
        "command": "subtitle",
        "params": {
            "text": "She holds tight to the warm, golden color, and it feels as though she too has become a wild beast dashing on all fours.",
            "x": 300,
            "y": 370,
            "alignment": "center",
            "size": 24,
            "delay": 0.04,
            "width": 750
        },
        "text": "She holds tight to the warm, golden color, and it feels as though she too has become a wild beast dashing on all fours."
    },
    {
        "command": "subtitle",
        "params": {
            "text": "At last, she no longer fears the nightmare that chases her. She cries for the things she has lost no more. Instead, she dashes forward freely in the darkness.",
